# Claws Mail mailmbox plugin configuration
# This plugin is loaded at runtime by Claws Mail and does not require a dedicated config file.
# There are no user-editable configuration directives exposed in the plugin's documentation.
# The plugin is activated via Claws Mail's plugin system and configured interactively via the UI:
#   "Edit -> Preferences -> Plugins -> mailmbox" or "Add mailbox -> mbox (etPan!)"
# Any service dependencies (e.g. remote mbox servers) are handled by the Claws Mail application
# configuration, not by this plugin-specific config file.
# No user-editable configuration exists for claws-mail-mailmbox-plugin
# The plugin is loaded via Claws Mail's plugin system and used via 'Add mailbox → mbox (etPan!)...'
# See claws-mail(1) and claws-mail-mailmbox-plugin(7) for usage details